# Comments only: keep every rule out of this file.
#
# Cloudflare treats every rule after the first splat (`*`) or `:placeholder`
# as dynamic, and dynamic rules are capped at 100 (static: 2000). The adapter
# appends the static redirects from src/lib/seo/redirects.ts below this file,
# so a splat here would demote all of them and the rest would be dropped.
#
# The old Hexo /tags/*, /categories/* and /archives/* rules live in
# src/lib/seo/redirect-rules.ts and are appended at the very end by
# src/integrations/legacy-list-redirects.ts. tests/redirect-rules.test.ts
# checks the merged file.
